      {
        "id": 39159,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-12T17:05:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Wow, your Cosmitron's Luck never ran out. &nbsp;Early EPE's in every game, Cosmo really wanted that trophy.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Reading your posts makes me want to start a pvp league for heroes, and give commentary and analysis on the fights.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"We're here with Dawn, who was heavily favored in this fight, but went down in the fourth round, What happened out there Dawn?\"</p><p>\"Well I thought we had a great game plan going out there today, but with those Explosives popping out like that there's really nothing you can do.\"</p><p><em>\"All Humans must be Annihilated.\"</em></p><p>\"I hear you back there Omni you cheat! &nbsp;Who shuffled your deck huh? &nbsp;Heart of the cards my @#3!\"</p><p><em>\"Organic life is inferior.\"</em></p><p>\"How about you come say that to my face you hunk of scrap! &nbsp;I'll tear you apart with my bare hands!\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Yeah, we need pregame and post game next time. &nbsp;Maybe some Mean Gene style interviews.</p>",
